@startuml
participant Prescriber
participant "FHIR API" as API
alt Approve proposal
Prescriber->API: POST /ServiceRequest/{id}/$approve
API->API: Validate proposal and prescriber rights
API->API: Create approved prescription and update tasks
API-->Prescriber: 200 OK + Parameters.location
else Reject proposal
Prescriber->API: POST /ServiceRequest/{id}/$reject
API->API: Validate proposal and prescriber rights
API->API: Mark proposal workflow as rejected
API-->Prescriber: 200 OK + Parameters.location
end
@enduml
